# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# L2 partial — the required grade L2 on the source gate means an actor granted
# below L2 gets the grade-gated `human` disposition (withheld pending
# oversight) rather than auto. This layer declares a withhold-pending-
# oversight floor for personal-data and security-control footprints (AI Act
# Art. 14(4)(a)/Art. 26). Independent
# of grade, any action tagged `consequential` is reserved to a human reviewer
# before it takes effect (Art. 14(4)(c): correctly interpret the output before
# relying on it).
actor agent grade L2
human reviewer role reviewer
gate  action risk high grade L2 grant agent
reserve agent-action by reviewer when tags contains consequential
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
